<roster id="qqmwla8" name="boc-001-all-units" battleScribeVersion="2.03" generatedBy="https://newrecruit.eu" gameSystemId="e51d-b1a3-75fc-dc3g" gameSystemName="Age of Sigmar 4.0" gameSystemRevision="98" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/rosterSchema"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="3230" /></costs><costLimits><costLimit name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costLimits><forces><force id="r8r2e3n" name="✦ General's Handbook 2026-27" entryId="0151-9c5b-2f1e-32d4" catalogueId="6cc-9eb2-c5b4-2877" catalogueRevision="26" catalogueName="Beasts of Chaos [LEGENDS]"><selections><selection id="sq66jbe" name="Allow Legends" entryId="7e59-2237-4890-a80a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" name="Configuration" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="uhe10hn" name="Allow Legends" entryId="7e59-2237-4890-a80a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" name="Configuration" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="umos74i" name="Battle Traits: Beasts of Chaos" entryId="5eef-030c-9c03-dc49::6ef5-2a41-46d3-c7f4" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e260-0300-1b53-ca6f" name="Rituals of Ruin" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects:
***Warping Curse:*** Pick an enemy unit within 12&quot; of a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos Hero^^** or, if there is a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos Hero^^** in reserve, within 12&quot; of a battlefield edge to be the target. Then, roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.
***Brand of Wild Fury:*** Pick a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos Hero^^** or, if there is a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos Hero^^** in reserve, wholly within 12&quot; of a battlefield edge to be the target. Then, roll a dice. On a 2+, the target has **^^Ward (6+)^^** for the rest of the turn.
***Bestial Instinct:*** Pick a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos Hero^^** or, if there is a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos Hero^^** in reserve, wholly within 12&quot; of a battlefield edge to be the target. Then, roll a dice. On a 2+, add 1 to wound rolls for the target's combat attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1e60-c3f0-c103-7ac2" name="Masters of the Wilderness" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos^^** unit that has not been deployed.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Set up that unit in reserve in ambush. It has now been deployed.
*Designer's Note: Any number of friendly* **^^Beasts of Chaos^^** *units can start the battle in reserve – even your entire Beasts of Chaos army!*</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Deploy^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="cb2b-b906-461a-cf74" name="Beastherd Ambush" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos^^** unit that is in ambush.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Set up that unit on the battlefield wholly within 9&quot; of a battlefield edge and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.
For the rest of the turn, add 1 to charge rolls for that unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="3360-1158-e879-9606" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" name="Reference" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="str6fu" name="Battle Formation" entryId="d8bd-a82f-e173-78d7" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="urdxfq" name="Battle Formation" entryId="d8bd-a82f-e173-78d7" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="swgppdl" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="uxgjyxk" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="szq7r1k" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="ca45-bd47-9de1-6c4a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="v4f7tym" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="ca45-bd47-9de1-6c4a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="t2jdtjo" name="Spell Lore" entryId="e806-6063-f8e4-dcff" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="t3hpxp" name="Lore of the Twisted Wilds" entryId="a64d-d2d7-3e41-7954::a415-7dcd-0814-85e3" entryGroupId="a64d-d2d7-3e41-7954::a20d-08c9-ea8f-33e7" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="t4qfxv9" name="Devolve" entryId="a64d-d2d7-3e41-7954::a661-dbfd-e030-3712::bcd2-36fc-3817-dd29" entryGroupId="a64d-d2d7-3e41-7954::a661-dbfd-e030-3712::c4da-6f3d-a13d-c576" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Twisted Wilds"><profiles><profile id="6e4c-7fa2-52be-998c" name="Devolve" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy non-**^^Hero^^** unit within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn:
• The target unit has a maximum control score of 1.
• The target cannot use commands.
• Each time the target moves, if the caster is on the battlefield, the target must end that move no further from the caster than it was at the start of the move.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="t48oj79" name="Vicious Stranglethorns" entryId="a64d-d2d7-3e41-7954::a661-dbfd-e030-3712::19f0-7157-940f-3084" entryGroupId="a64d-d2d7-3e41-7954::a661-dbfd-e030-3712::c4da-6f3d-a13d-c576" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Twisted Wilds"><profiles><profile id="5394-f529-76a8-18b5" name="Vicious Stranglethorns" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn:
• Halve the target's Move characteristic.
• Subtract 1 from the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for the target, to a minimum of 1.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Movement</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="t4lcsy3" name="Viletide" entryId="a64d-d2d7-3e41-7954::a661-dbfd-e030-3712::31f7-16a1-3229-6e91" entryGroupId="a64d-d2d7-3e41-7954::a661-dbfd-e030-3712::c4da-6f3d-a13d-c576" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of the Twisted Wilds"><profiles><profile id="9e2d-9462-78e4-4505" name="Viletide" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target. In addition, until the start of your next turn, the target cannot use commands.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id