Cover, Unstable**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="620d-c0ca-509c-b486" name="Entropic Lodestone" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">From the second battle round onwards, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of melee weapons used by friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos^^** units while they are wholly within 24&quot; of this terrain feature.
If this terrain feature is wholly within 18&quot; of the centre of the battlefield, this ability affects all friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos^^** units on the battlefield instead of those wholly within 24&quot; of it.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="b63f-a5f8-6a7d-2965" name="Herdstone" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><categories><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="e902-e0b8-b5ea-d527" name="BEASTS OF CHAOS" entryId="e902-e0b8-b5ea-d527" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /></categories></selection></selections><costs><cost name="Force Category - GHB" typeId="de92-2099-fbf7-a156" value="1" /></costs><categories><category name="Configuration" id="rg7nw6m" primary="false" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" /><category name="Reference" id="0ht1gyf" primary="false" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" /><category name="Army Composition" id="rhb594" primary="false" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" /><category name="FACTION TERRAIN" id="riri6bo" primary="false" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" /><category name="Illegal Units" id="7m1zb3h" primary="false" entryId="(Illegal Units)" /></categories><forces><force id="qmbhuc8" name="Auxillary Units" entryId="6084-3baa-f00b-ac0a::8732-47c4-9f1c-e71e" catalogueId="6cc-9eb2-c5b4-2877" catalogueRevision="26" catalogueName="Beasts of Chaos [LEGENDS]"><selections><selection id="bx21fjc" name="Beastlord" entryId="0a99-b598-81b1-a7e5::9652-a6eb-7e57-9761" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e037-020c-f699-bfc3" name="Beastlord" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b628-c9cd-4fb8-bebb" name="Hatred of Heroes" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit is in combat with any enemy **^^Heroes^^**, add 1 to hit rolls and wound rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8bfc-6807-c405-11a6" name="Call of Battle" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Brayherd Infantry^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="bz4nx2" name="Beastlord" entryId="0a99-b598-81b1-a7e5::52bc-e5f2-f34b-4892" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="c5wlyul" name="Paired Man-ripper Axes" entryId="0a99-b598-81b1-a7e5::f63f-001c-9712-80cb" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="da76-eb25-5928-57ff" name="Paired Man-ripper Axes" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti-**^^Hero^^** (+1 Rend), Crit (2 Hits)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="150" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="e902-e0b8-b5ea-d527" name="BEASTS OF CHAOS" entryId="e902-e0b8-b5ea-d527" primary="false" /><category id="bf15-f13d-cca6-29d8" name="BRAYHERD" entryId="bf15-f13d-cca6-29d8" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="ccl91cq" name="Doombull" entryId="d182-93b1-4b9c-1d54::f8d6-201f-bb35-942c" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="99ad-c92e-564f-6242" name="Doombull" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="cdd8-410c-83fb-65b5" name="Slaughterer's Call" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Warherd^^** unit that is not in combat and is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, add 1 to the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for the target, to a maximum of 3.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="4561-22c9-009f-336c" name="Alpha Charge" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this phase, pick an enemy unit within 1&quot; of it to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="cdchotn" name="Doombull" entryId="d182-93b1-4b9c-1d54::f182-094c-ab97-70d1" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="chusjr" name="Alphabeast Horns" entryId="d182-93b1-4b9c-1d54::c4af-0397-cae4-2f49" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="df64-ddfa-913d-d580" name="Alphabeast Horns" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Charge (+1 Damage)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="chfra5" name="Slaughterer's Axe" entryId="d182-93b1-4b9c-1d54::ad4a-016a-38c3-4b04" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="310f-7d2e-18f3-28bc" name="Slaughterer's Axe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="170" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="e902-e0b8-b5ea-d527" name="BEASTS OF CHAOS" entryId="e902-e0b8-b5ea-d527" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="8fec-20f5-8470-a056" name="WARHERD" entryId="8fec-20f5-8470-a056" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="co3gmog" name="Dragon Ogor Shaggoth" entryId="aad6-9438-ee7b-d7a0::5f38-255a-16a0-e4dc" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="0a5a-81d4-48b0-3bf3" name="Dragon Ogor Shaggoth" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ab7f-51e5-535a-5614" name="Beneath the Tempest" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick each enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 2+, Heal (X) this unit, where X is an amount equal to the roll. Then, roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="100e-0da0-ab50-5c76" name="Scion of the Primordial Storm" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Spell^^** ability</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit or a friendly **Dragon Ogors** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit was picked to be the target of that spell, roll a dice. On a 4+, ignore the effect of that spell on this unit or that friendly unit. This unit can use this ability more than once per phase but only once per **^^Spell^^** ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="cp6rq6" name="Dragon Ogor Shaggoth" entryId="aad6-9438-ee7b-d7a0::1b03-8826-fa41-f9e0" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ctyefy5" name="Crackling Bolts" entryId="aad6-9438-ee7b-d7a0::1552-16f6-9e97-58de" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2dd8-fe6c-8373-ac1d" name="Crackling Bolts" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">2D6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Crit (2 Hits), Shoot in Combat</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ctoj8kw" name="Storm-forged Axe" entryId="aad6-9438-ee7b-d7a0::b60a-fc95-8dda-9ba4" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c7d1-8b56-a51f-41ed" name="Storm-forged Axe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="220" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="e902-e0b8-b5ea-d527" name="BEASTS OF CHAOS" entryId="e902-e0b8-b5ea-d527" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="7be1-3285-0de8-35da" name="THUNDERSCORN" entryId="7be1-3285-0de8-35da" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="d7302w" name="Great Bray-Shaman" entryId="c422-d507-2624-2335::dbb1-5ebf-28ce-eb6e" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="42a5-052e-1fc0-a128" name="Great Bray-Shaman" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="de8f-9720-dfde-0719" name="Infuse with Bestial Vigour" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Beasts of Chaos^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, the target can use a **^^Run^^** ability and still use **^^Charge^^** abilities later in the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="d8rfu9" name="Great Bray-Shaman" entryId="c422-d507-2624-2335::226f-d2a8-f71a-1eb8" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="df1wmt5" name="Fetish Staff" entryId="c422-d507-2624-2335::111e-3606-af8e-75d0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2584-479b-68a4-6c4c" name="Fetish Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="140" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="e902-e0b8-b5ea-d527" name="BEASTS OF CHAOS" entryId="e902-e0b8-b5ea-d527" primary="false" /><category id="bf15-f13d-cca6-29d8" name="BRAYHERD" entryId="bf15-f13d-cca6-29d8" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><cat