• 1 model in the target unit is slain.
• **Heal (X)** this unit, where **X** is an amount equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="4840-519b-9a61-d9cb" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Butchering Blades** is 4.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="juguvck" name="Ghorgon" entryId="b839-9260-eb9f-3196::bd64-44a8-1edf-bc34" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="jvs6d3r" name="Butchering Blades" entryId="b839-9260-eb9f-3196::c13e-5ec2-3667-544a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="289b-e9bc-bab9-6294" name="Butchering Blades" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4